# sitka_spruce: the towering Sitka spruce behind the cabin's roof
# (GAME_DESIGN 11.11: stacked tiers with drooping tips, taller than
# everything). Twelve tiers stacked down the trunk (sitka_tier_01 to _12),
# each lit on its top and shaded beneath, so the light steps down tier by
# tier; each tier's tips droop, some a pixel lower than the rest; the
# upper tiers narrow into a ragged spire with a leader on top, and the sky
# shows between them where a tier's tips lift clear of the one below. The
# lower tiers are laid first, so each tier's shaded underside hangs over
# the lit top of the one below. The anchor, 0,0, is the foot of the trunk
# (hidden by the roof). 39 wide, 125 tall.
# the trunk's foot, below the last tier
C 10  L 0,-15 0,0  L 1,-15 1,0
T sitka_tier_12 0,-35  T sitka_tier_11 0,-46  T sitka_tier_10 0,-57  T sitka_tier_09 0,-68  T sitka_tier_08 0,-78  T sitka_tier_07 0,-87
T sitka_tier_06 0,-96  T sitka_tier_05 0,-103  T sitka_tier_04 0,-108  T sitka_tier_03 0,-114  T sitka_tier_02 0,-120  T sitka_tier_01 0,-121
# the leader over the top tier
C 12  L 0,-124 0,-121
